+# Deterministic Recording Engine (M1 Scaffold)
+
+This patch introduces a minimal source scaffold for Helium's deterministic
+recording engine in Chromium.
+
+Scope:
+- deterministic session state model
+- fixed-step virtual time API surface
+- explicit fault and recovery hooks
+
+Non-goals:
+- compositor/Viz barriers
+- capture or encode integration
+
+Follow-up milestones add:
+- browser process service wiring
+- DevTools control domain
+- compositor/capture commit barriers
+- cross-process synchronization
+
